n  @startuml
!include theme.puml
title ICT University ERP | System context
top to bottom direction
actor "Student" as student
actor "Instructor / staff\nHR employee" as staff
actor "Institution / platform\nadministrator" as admin
rectangle "ERP system boundary" {
  rectangle "React 19 web application\nERP_System repository\nStudent + staff self-service" as ui
  rectangle "ERP API platform\nERP_System_backend repository\nIdentity | Academic | Finance | HR" as erp
  ui --> erp : Same-origin HTTPS / JSON\nBearer JWT + refresh cookie
}
cloud "Mobile-money provider\nMTN MoMo adapter OR\nexplicit simulated gateway" as payment
actor "Operator / release approver" as ops
rectangle "Jenkins + registry\nPipeline definitions present\nLive execution unverified" as ci
database "Off-host backup repository\nTARGET: not provisioned" as backup #FFF5DE
student --> ui : Enroll / grades / invoices
staff --> ui : Leave / check-in / payslips
admin --> erp : Administrative APIs\nUI screens mostly placeholders
erp --> payment : request-to-pay\nquery authoritative status
ops --> ci : Approve release
ci --> erp : Pinned image deployment
erp ..> backup : Planned encrypted backup + WAL
note bottom of erp
Institution = tenant; campus is not a separate tenant.
No cross-service database queries.
One local asynchronous workflow: enrollment -> invoice.
end note
legend bottom
  Solid: implemented interaction or defined integration
  Dotted / amber: target, not an operational claim
  Provider callback ingress is not open in current gateway policy
endlegend
@enduml
